 "annotations": [
  {
   "id": "shell-note",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -170,
   "w": 760,
   "page": "page-1",
   "text": "Shell: left sidebar replaces the old Docs / Contributor / Admin top tabs; one app for docs, dashboard and operations. Tokens lifted from ui/src (bg #faf9f7, sage #4a5a4c / #2d4a2f, border #e5e3df). Sign-in is OIDC (bearer to dcops-api); reads stay on the read-only Kubernetes client."
  },
  {
   "id": "netbox-note",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 760,
   "page": "page-2",
   "text": "NetBox sections share one generic list + detail pattern (auto-discovered CRDs, CrdTable/CrdDetail evolved). Prefixes and Devices shown as the representative kinds; every other kind uses the same two screens with its own columns."
  },
  {
   "id": "cert-note",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 760,
   "page": "page-4",
   "text": "Certificates: state column derives from CRD conditions (Healthy \u00b7 Renewal due \u00b7 Drift found \u00b7 Failed \u00b7 Unowned \u00b7 Stale); no YAML anywhere. Numbers come from the September scan (5,368 rows, 2,829 unowned). Maturity per CMMI scale."
  },
  {
   "id": "import-note",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 760,
   "page": "page-5",
   "text": "Import wizard follows EPIC-CM-002: file goes straight to the bucket via a one-time signed URL; the API only handles metadata; preview \u2192 confirm \u2192 background apply. Copy is written for non-technical Operations managers."
  }
